        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Organizations: Ghana Club 100, Ghana Investment Promotion Centre, Government of Ghana, Ghana Chamber of Mines, Ghana National Petroleum Corporation\n- Places: Ghana\n- Topics: company rankings, investment promotion\n\nFacts:\n- Ghana Club 100 is a yearly official list of the top 100 companies in Ghana.\n- In 1998, the Ghana Investment Promotion Centre first compiled the Ghana Club 100 to recognize the top 100 companies in Ghana and encourage competition and improvement in company products and services.\n- The Ghana Investment Promotion Centre is a Government of Ghana agency that encourages, promotes, and facilitates investments in all sectors of Ghana's economy except mining and petroleum.\n- In Ghana, the Ghana Chamber of Mines handles mining investments, and the Ghana National Petroleum Corporation handles petroleum investments.",
